<title>LATVIA: Most yields drop at Latvian T-bill sale.</title>
<headline>Most yields drop at Latvian T-bill sale.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields on two out of three maturities of Latvian Treasury bills dipped at auction on Wednesday, with only the 28-day rate rising, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>No one-year bills were sold today.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD   (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID    SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	9.89	  9.73	   1.25   1.90   1.20</p>
<p> 91-day	10.25	 10.29	  1.50   1.95   1.40</p>
<p> 182-day     10.44	 11.51	  1.75   7.0    1.75</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
